{"4762380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "High Charisma", "steam_appid": 4762380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Charm your way to the top.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a bard. Your boyfriend has been captured by Malachar the Lich and imprisoned at the summit of a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  60-floor tower. Most heroes would grab a sword. You grabbed your lute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High Charisma is a first-person turn-based dungeon crawler where music is your weapon. Rather than cutting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  down every creature in your path, use your instruments to charm spirit beasts and turn them into allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Build a party of former enemies, master new instruments, and ascend through crypts, frozen caverns, fire</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  pits, shadow halls, and storm-battered spires to rescue your hunk at the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><strong>Love is a Battlefield</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Every enemy can become an ally. Use your charisma and instruments to befriend spirit beasts mid-combat and build your party from the creatures you encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <strong>Music as a Weapon</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Wield 12+ instruments like lutes, harps, fiddles, flutes, and accordions. Each instrument changes how you fight and how you charm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow Stronger</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Level up, unlock feats, and gain abilities to become the bard the tower fears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixelated Dark Fantasy Fun</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Hand-crafted 32x32 pixel sprites in a 3D dungeon environments. A retro aesthetic and an original soundtrack with 50+ tracks.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Charm your way to the top.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a bard. Your boyfriend has been captured by Malachar the Lich and imprisoned at the summit of a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  60-floor tower. Most heroes would grab a sword. You grabbed your lute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High Charisma is a first-person turn-based dungeon crawler where music is your weapon. Rather than cutting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  down every creature in your path, use your instruments to charm spirit beasts and turn them into allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Build a party of former enemies, master new instruments, and ascend through crypts, frozen caverns, fire</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  pits, shadow halls, and storm-battered spires to rescue your hunk at the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><strong>Love is a Battlefield</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Every enemy can become an ally. Use your charisma and instruments to befriend spirit beasts mid-combat and build your party from the creatures you encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <strong>Music as a Weapon</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Wield 12+ instruments like lutes, harps, fiddles, flutes, and accordions. Each instrument changes how you fight and how you charm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow Stronger</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Level up, unlock feats, and gain abilities to become the bard the tower fears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixelated Dark Fantasy Fun</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Hand-crafted 32x32 pixel sprites in a 3D dungeon environments. A retro aesthetic and an original soundtrack with 50+ tracks.</p>", "short_description": "A first-person turn-based dungeon crawler where you play 